# baked/cached artifacts (built locally, never uploaded)
# NOTE: chain/M.json and chain/CTRL.json are FROZEN doctrine artifacts
# (calibration + controller fit) and MUST be tracked -- never ignore them.
# Same for samples/depth/*.npy: gate-depended priors are frozen evidence.
*.npy
!samples/depth/*.npy
# ENGRAM blobs (41MB full float64 dwarfs the repo; regenerable, gated)
stores/*.npz
*.pth
*.pt
*.bin
weights/
luts/
captures/
mid_*/
seq*/
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.tmp/
# ingest scale artifacts (32MB-200MB+ frozen counts; regenerable via scripts/ingest.py + freeze_piece.py)
data/piece_bigrams.npz
data/w20k_piece_bigrams.npz
data_ingest/*_bigrams.npz
